<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume fell in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications fell 26.0 percent in the week ended September 6, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>The volume of applications to refinance mortgages declined 36.0 percent, while applications to purchase mortgages dipped 23.5 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index dropped 20.0 percent to 226.8 from 283.6 in the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 2.4 percent to 188.9 from 193.5, it said.  </p>
